    },
    "How to choose an interval and remember to blink between reminders. Click to learn more.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How to choose an interval and remember to blink between reminders. Click to learn more."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Как выбрать интервал и не забывать моргать между сигналами. Нажмите, чтобы узнать больше."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every 20 minutes, look into the distance for at least 20 seconds. Click to learn more.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every 20 minutes, look into the distance for at least 20 seconds. Click to learn more."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Каждые 20 минут смотрите вдаль не менее 20 секунд. Нажмите, чтобы узнать больше."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporarily pause reminders when you need uninterrupted time. Click to learn more.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temporarily pause reminders when you need uninterrupted time. Click to learn more."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Поставьте напоминания временно на паузу, если не хотите отвлекаться. Нажмите, чтобы узнать больше."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People usually blink about 15–20 times a minute — roughly every 3–4 seconds. We often blink less while using a screen; the rate varies by person and activity.\n\nIf you find it comfortable to blink with every reminder, try an interval of 3–4 seconds. With less frequent reminders, remember to blink between them too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "People usually blink about 15–20 times a minute — roughly every 3–4 seconds. We often blink less while using a screen; the rate varies by person and activity.\n\nIf you find it comfortable to blink with every reminder, try an interval of 3–4 seconds. With less frequent reminders, remember to blink between them too."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Обычно человек моргает около 15–20 раз в минуту — примерно раз в 3–4 секунды. При работе за экраном мы часто моргаем реже; частота зависит от человека и занятия.\n\nЕсли удобно моргать с каждым сигналом, попробуйте интервал 3–4 секунды. При более редких напоминаниях старайтесь моргать и между сигналами."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every 20 minutes, look away from the screen for at least 20 seconds. Focus on an object at least 20 feet — about 6 metres — away.\n\nYou can change the reminder interval and break duration in settings. The countdown begins when you select “Start break”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every 20 minutes, look away from the screen for at least 20 seconds. Focus on an object at least 20 feet — about 6 metres — away.\n\nYou can change the reminder interval and break duration in settings. The countdown begins when you select “Start break”."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Раз в 20 минут отводите взгляд от экрана минимум на 20 секунд и смотрите на объект не ближе 20 футов — примерно 6 метров.\n\nПериод напоминания и длительность отдыха можно изменить в настройках. Отсчёт начинается после нажатия «Начать отдых»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporarily pause reminders when you do not want distractions. This pauses blink reminders and automatic break invitations.\n\nChoose a duration and select “Pause reminders”. Reminders resume automatically; “Until resumed” keeps them paused until you resume them yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temporarily pause reminders when you do not want distractions. This pauses blink reminders and automatic break invitations.\n\nChoose a duration and select “Pause reminders”. Reminders resume automatically; “Until resumed” keeps them paused until you resume them yourself."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Поставьте напоминания временно на паузу, если не хотите отвлекаться. Она приостанавливает сигналы моргания и автоматические предложения отдыха.\n\nВыберите длительность и нажмите «Приостановить». Напоминания возобновятся автоматически, а вариант «До включения» действует до ручного продолжения."
          }
        }
      }
    },
